              "id": "875bb64",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section section--light\"><div class=\"section__inner--narrow\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><h2 class=\"section__headline\" style=\"text-align:center;\">The clock is ticking on the old model.</h2><div class=\"section__body section__body--center\"><p>You're watching the AI headlines. You know the writing is on the wall. Embrace it or watch the practice lose value. Meanwhile, the only exits on offer are ugly: sell to a bigger firm that scatters longtime clients (the kind of sale where clients find out from an email address change), or hold on and ride the value down.</p></div></div></div>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
        }
