          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "3b30c51",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section section--warm\"><div class=\"section__inner\"><h2 class=\"section__headline section__headline--center\">You have two paths forward.</h2><div class=\"two-paths__grid\"><div class=\"two-paths__card reveal\"><h3 class=\"two-paths__card-title\">Rebuild the Practice Around Your Life</h3><div class=\"two-paths__card-body\"><p>Keep the practice. Use AI (on your terms) to take the drudgery. Rebuild the schedule so the week fits around your life. The practice still runs — but it doesn't run you.</p></div><a href=\"demo-contact.html\" class=\"btn btn--primary\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;\">Talk About Rebuilding →</a></div><div class=\"two-paths__card reveal reveal-d1\"><h3 class=\"two-paths__card-title\">Exit to Client</h3><div class=\"two-paths__card-body\"><p>Sell the practice to the people who already know exactly what it's worth: your clients. They become owners instead of casualties of the sale. You walk away with the value you built, and the relationships you spent thirty years cultivating don't get scattered by strangers.</p></div><a href=\"demo-exit-to-client.html\" class=\"btn btn--primary\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;\">Learn About Exit to Client →</a></div></div></div></div>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
