                "html": "<div class=\"cta-section\"><div class=\"cta-section__inner\"><h2 class=\"cta-section__headline reveal\">Not sure which path is yours?</h2><div class=\"cta-section__body reveal reveal-d1\"><p>That's exactly what the first conversation is for. Tell us where you are, and we'll help you see the way forward.</p></div><div class=\"cta-section__actions reveal reveal-d2\"><a href=\"demo-contact.html\" class=\"btn btn--white btn--arrow\">Start the Conversation →</a><a href=\"demo-newsletter.html\" class=\"btn btn--outline-white\">Join the Newsletter →</a></div></div></div>"
